  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "You must be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "It was I who sent an email\n",
        "to Professor Elm earlier.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "You must be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "It was I who sent an email\n",
        "to Professor Elm earlier.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "This is what I want Professor Elm\n",
        "to examine.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "A friend of mine from Ecruteak gave\n",
        "it to me.\r",
        "I bet you can’t find this kind of\n",
        "Egg in Johto.\r",
        "I thought Professor Elm might be able\n",
        "to tell what this is.\r",
        "“He’s the best when it comes to the\n",
        "research of Pokémon evolution.”\r",
        "That’s a quote from the famous\n",
        "Professor Oak.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "You are returning to Professor Elm?\r",
        "Here. Your Pokémon should have\n",
        "some rest.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry to trouble you, having you go\n",
        "back and forth.\r",
        "But please make sure to hand it to\n",
        "Professor Elm!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Life is delightful!\n",
        "Always, new discoveries to be made!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Kimono Girls? What’re you talking\n",
        "about? I don’t know such people.\f",
        "Hee hee...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: And with that...\r",
        "I’m Professor Oak, a Pokémon\n",
        "researcher!\r",
        "So you’re {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "I was just visiting my friend\n",
        "Mr. Pokémon.\r",
        "I heard you were running an errand\n",
        "for Professor Elm, so I waited here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: And with that...\r",
        "I’m Professor Oak, a Pokémon\n",
        "researcher!\r",
        "So you’re {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "I was just visiting my friend\n",
        "Mr. Pokémon.\r",
        "I heard you were running an errand\n",
        "for Professor Elm, so I waited here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: Oh! What’s this?\n",
        "A rare Pokémon!\r",
        "I see!\n",
        "You must be helping Professor Elm’s\f",
        "research! I think I understand why\f",
        "Professor Elm gave you that Pokémon.\r",
        "You will treat your Pokémon with love\n",
        "and care, it seems.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Oak: ...Ah!\r",
        "You seem to be dependable.\n",
        "How would you like to help me out?\r",
        "See? This is the latest version of\n",
        "the Pokédex.\r",
        "It automatically records data on\n",
        "Pokémon you’ve seen or caught.\r",
        "It’s a high-tech encyclopedia!\n",
        "I’d like you to have it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the Pokédex\n",
        "from Professor Oak!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Go meet many kinds of Pokémon and\n",
        "complete that Pokédex!\f",
        "But I’ve stayed too long.\r",
        "I have to get to Goldenrod for my\n",
        "usual radio show.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I have a feeling that\n",
        "this is not the last time we’ll meet...\r",
        "Let’s exchange numbers\n",
        "just to be on the safe side.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Go meet many kinds of Pokémon and\n",
        "complete that Pokédex!\f",
        "But I’ve stayed too long.\r",
        "I have to get to Goldenrod for my\n",
        "usual radio show.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I have a feeling that\n",
        "this is not the last time we’ll meet...\r",
        "Let’s exchange numbers\n",
        "just to be on the safe side.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Professor Oak\n",
        "in the Pokégear!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm? That Red Scale! What’s that?\n",
        "A red GYARADOS?\f",
        "That’s rare! I... I want it...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, would you\n",
        "care to trade it?\r",
        "I can offer this Exp. Share I got\n",
        "from Professor Oak. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm? That Red Scale! What’s that?\n",
        "A red GYARADOS?\f",
        "That’s rare! I... I want it...\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, would you\n",
        "care to trade it?\r",
        "I can offer this Exp. Share I got\n",
        "from Professor Oak. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00018",
      "garbage": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00019",
      "en_US": "Arrgh, I reckon yer Bag’s full."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s disappointing.\n",
        "That happens to be very rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "I have something I want you to have\n",
        "and was just about to send an email\f",
        "to Professor Oak.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "I have something I want you to have\n",
        "and was just about to send an email\f",
        "to Professor Oak.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "The thing is...\n",
        "A friend of mine from Hoenn\f",
        "came over to give this to me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Blue Orb!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Red Orb!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "That Orb has something to do with\n",
        "the ancient ruins located past\f",
        "Cianwood City, called the\f",
        "Embedded Tower.\r",
        "But only a handful of Trainers can\n",
        "reach there...\r",
        "That’s where you come in.\r",
        "Professor Oak thinks highly of you,\n",
        "and you are the proud Champion\f",
        "after all.\r",
        "I’m sure you can solve the mystery\n",
        "of the Orb and the secret of the ruins."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "The Embedded Tower is past Cianwood,\n",
        "somewhere in the Cliff Cave.\r",
        "Or so I heard.\r",
        "Or so I remember.\r",
        "Or so I believe!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s packed with foreign magazines.\r",
        "Can’t even read their titles..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a big computer.\n",
        "Hmm. It’s broken."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0377_R30R0201_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "A whole pile of strange coins!\f",
        "Maybe they’re from another country..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
